<body>
    <h1>Operation Dashboard</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<style>[data-colorid=3Dxvx73vcz0r]{color:#0747a6} html[data-color-mode=3Dda=
rk] [data-colorid=3Dxvx73vcz0r]{color:#5999f8}</style>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h3 local-id=3D"9e20a40fe1f9" id=3D"OperationDashboard-OperationDashboardMe=
trics"><strong>Operation Dashboard Metrics</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1616" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"7e=
78db67-8d93-4532-8ceb-a3821703907c" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 257.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 548.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 404.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 404.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cd3dbc25a38c">
<th data-local-id=3D"ab8a027afbe9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7c0dc2c535fc"><strong>Metrics</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f854f47e8e46" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4c61b47c989e"><strong>Definition</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a9c6cbf523d9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"396623e6bf38"><strong>Example</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d559c96030c5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e1efc1be05ad"><strong>Image</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3bad90566e12">
<td data-local-id=3D"24365bf160a5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"0ab9dbcc331b">
<li local-id=3D"cd8e13b961ca">
<p local-id=3D"3fd94cb2de37"><strong>Pending Order</strong></p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"efeeacf32ef8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6abe37d2e359">The total number of orders that have been plac=
ed but have not yet been processed or confirmed by the operations/telesales=
 team.<br>
: Life Time Pending Order</p>
<ul local-id=3D"c14a0ca1f474">
<li local-id=3D"a10d51c99b16">
<p local-id=3D"792333d5fbd6"><strong>Count number of orders where Status =
=3D Pending, no date range, and no channel. Just based on status. [Life Tim=
e]</strong></p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d97043e2b80b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"8cf2ee63017a">
<li local-id=3D"699f4177-b31c-4c8f-b97c-f4343fad5b1d">
<p local-id=3D"0077f5ab60e6">A customer places 25 orders today.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a96f1c5b-78c6-4190-a1de-f40a69b3104b">
<p local-id=3D"c8f1cc990436">The telesales team has confirmed 18 of them.</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a780c088-0a75-4c47-8836-b12dec711526">
<p local-id=3D"81597a8aafbc"><strong>Pending Orders =3D 7</strong></p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cfc86ee61ef8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c6f778093f2a"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4d2f7ca3edd2">
<td data-local-id=3D"84306945fe8d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"68a3b842e103">
<li local-id=3D"14d68a8fe082">
<p local-id=3D"474aeafb3890"><strong>Schedule Orders</strong></p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2614aa2b43d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"000959e3b3b5">Pending order that is planned to be processed,=
 packed, dispatched, or delivered at a future date and time instead of imme=
diately.<br>
also Order Type should be scheduled Order<br>
Life time Schedule Order</p>
<ul local-id=3D"0a3528a49a33">
<li local-id=3D"c5b94d44b97b">
<p local-id=3D"9136524a9ea4"><strong>Count number of orders where Type =3D =
Scheduled, no date range, and no channel. Just based on Type. [Life Time]</=
strong></p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"40d51cfab0c1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"c70791a3e220">
<li local-id=3D"b4db7ce3fbc1">
<p local-id=3D"b55711e15369">A customer placed an order on 26th July but as=
ked to deliver after 3 days.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1f9e91056710">
<p local-id=3D"713231b4547f">Responsible agent assign the order as schedule=
d to be delivered on 30th July.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"20b9fb7065ec">
<p local-id=3D"c635b33d10a9"><strong>Scheduled Orders =3D +1</strong></p></=
li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"31acd90aa4c4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9321e8e7a244"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b5b58e58adb5">
<td data-local-id=3D"0f575c64434d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"36b19b01433e">
<li local-id=3D"bbeb8ebbb31b">
<p local-id=3D"f0941aed0a2a"><strong>Advance Payment</strong></p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f6dbb069f283" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8b5068f9d3b3">Advance Payment is the amount of money collect=
ed from a customer before the order is fulfilled or delivered.<br>
Life time Advance payment<br><strong>Note : Advance Payment should be Statu=
s Pending. </strong><br></p>
<ul local-id=3D"7c8ab4051286">
<li local-id=3D"48c1ace23ee5">
<p local-id=3D"49df794c0725"><strong>Count number of orders where the order=
 has an advance payment, no date range, and no channel. [Life Time]</strong=
></p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"de7794fadb06" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"c0f42418f12b">
<li local-id=3D"34fe9dffce26">
<p local-id=3D"1f128fd475e1">Customer A places an order worth BDT100 and pa=
ys BDT20 in advance.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6a1cd32fa4e2">
<p local-id=3D"772562be5d35">Agent will record BDT20 as advance payment.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"c2a8682235fd">
<p local-id=3D"fe492200759d"><strong>Advance Payment =3D 20 Tk</strong></p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"698137866953">
<p local-id=3D"0e1c83dabdf3">Teleselse head or Operation team need to appro=
ved.</p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"58c83818b97d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df1ad66bcf07"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b5a34e4c3088">
<td data-local-id=3D"e6feefed2559" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d57b7224281f"><strong><span data-colorid=3D"xvx73vcz0r">Filt=
erable Metrics:</span></strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"78f94b67424a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ac7b74ef3b6d"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3be85ec7e791" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf4a1c511235"></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"92dc46f43dd0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"61b14e2487d8"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4f581abbf0c8">
<td data-local-id=3D"e6249b4f0bb5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"79a5d912d3e5">
<li local-id=3D"6ab0253c0159">
<p local-id=3D"7087f2ae2052"><strong>Total Order</strong></p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"30f031d66e0d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"036d5ac362d6">The total number of orders <strong>created</st=
rong> during the selected date range, regardless of their current status.</=
p>
<ul local-id=3D"3a62bd8d-6ec6-4a14-88a5-9497a0ed25c6">
<li local-id=3D"a8c95ce8-d173-4679-8d54-dc29ea5f8151">
<p local-id=3D"dec600c7d843">Filter orders by <strong>Order Creation Date</=
strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7ebd510e-86dc-46d3-8421-1fdd4f15ffef">
<p local-id=3D"b21c14b33afa">Count every order created within the selected =
date range.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"285b2e95-f757-4825-a59f-c7efbdec1bf6">
<p local-id=3D"295f58bacac2">Includes orders from all sources (Website, Adm=
in, App, etc.).</p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fc2cccceec9a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"61485c248b31">
<li local-id=3D"c6f3f3cf45a1">
<p local-id=3D"21d7fe6ca7bf">Filter a Date : <time datetime=3D"2027-07-20" =
class=3D"date-future">20 Jul 2027</time></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"45dd8feb9b73">
<p local-id=3D"96c3b8c54928">Custer place order in 19 July 20 order and 20 =
July 25 order.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4e531d5cc13a">
<p local-id=3D"1db764fddfc1">in filter <time datetime=3D"2027-07-20" class=
=3D"date-future">20 Jul 2027</time> output will: 25 order.</p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dd721ea5e5d9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ec58d85b190e"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fb258426783a">
<td data-local-id=3D"a48163ae3ee1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"a73561b319e0">
<li local-id=3D"60053216db10">
<p local-id=3D"3ad0e14b2df3"><strong>Pending Order</strong></p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5cdf122c913" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fbb1b8ee7501">The number of orders created during the select=
ed date range that have a status is pending.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d79b94ad56dc"><strong>Calculation Rule</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f80b679a-d7f7-4ca6-9788-a9843b00dd2f">
<li local-id=3D"a5499fed-8f82-41e9-a32d-adae3d3797a6">
<p local-id=3D"292b6f3aa9f0">Filter orders by <strong>Order Creation Date</=
strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"febd34a9-15b7-4c59-b453-7c4811f29d06">
<p local-id=3D"871e82b7f268">From those orders, count only the ones that ar=
e currently in <strong>Pending</strong> status.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"350ae28f-9d4f-461f-b10d-4d15c6b1f269">
<p local-id=3D"5e7abcd52aad">It does not matter when the status was last up=
dated.</p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"754ec49652b3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4f640545c409"><strong>Filter Date:</strong> July 20, 2027</p=
>
<ul local-id=3D"7a1129ab-9b8c-4937-a2bd-1e963fa419ec">
<li local-id=3D"4165971a-f9f5-4ec9-8c0e-9db83c6f8fed">
<p local-id=3D"326d7caa9aaa">Orders created =3D 25</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3a4ff2fc-a21b-48c6-b953-823f68a6c002">
<p local-id=3D"317ca7337c4d">Confirmed =3D 12</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9ed613c1-d8f6-4d7f-8798-167918d7e4b8">
<p local-id=3D"1befc95d0945">Cancelled =3D 3</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"43b7ae05-11af-483b-beef-7f46c44148d0">
<p local-id=3D"bae625d4a2bc">Remaining Pending =3D 10</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"fda93585bdf6"><strong>Result</strong></p>
<blockquote local-id=3D"d5ab961d-d200-4b13-80e8-b20709a52d1f">
<p local-id=3D"a84b1d9d7a33"><strong>Pending Orders =3D 10</strong></p>
</blockquote></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"057602654a31" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"54b4eda4a706"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7de9c0d5cd03">
<td data-local-id=3D"0be3e2861811" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"c2ff810f90d9">
<li local-id=3D"b2f15ee6e152">
<p local-id=3D"1d658050e721"><strong>Confirm Order</strong></p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"97a2ec8523b8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"126390e27017">The number of orders created during the select=
ed date range that were <strong>
<del>and</del> confirmed</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6acfce57bd16"><strong>Calculation Rule</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b47a89e3-7232-47e3-8e27-4db40dfddf0c">
<li local-id=3D"42486a53-80a8-4806-8b50-b4b7437623c2">
<p local-id=3D"9493e6475426">Filter orders by <strong>Order Creation Date</=
strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d3527856-b922-443d-98a7-be98e40be6d5">
<p local-id=3D"6b15c44f3043">Count the orders whose
<del></del>current status is <strong>Confirmed</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"43983605-6724-4d05-9a1b-8e32c0ef7b4c">
<p local-id=3D"6fee198833da">The confirmation may happen on any date. <stro=
ng>No need to check when confimed.</strong></p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7dd52771c51d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"124afad4-4ec4-412e-bff5-b5744fa871f5">
<li local-id=3D"07741a1a-0b85-4d4a-9dd4-42bb27f869ad">
<p local-id=3D"f6d2e6a4285c">Filter a Date : <time datetime=3D"2027-07-20" =
class=3D"date-future">20 Jul 2027</time></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aea57230-2bba-4568-9d09-6fb0200d8dc5">
<p local-id=3D"f1a210b95230">Custer place order in 19 July=3D 20 order and =
20 July=3D 25 order.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0e7cf0aa-11e4-493b-a856-a21b5b7c84ed">
<p local-id=3D"51210c77a620">Tele sales in 20 July Confirm order 12 order</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"90c673e4-32b7-4660-b461-814d6cf16aec">
<p local-id=3D"bf54e07ce498">in filter <time datetime=3D"2027-07-20" class=
=3D"date-future">20 Jul 2027</time> output will: 12 Orders</p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"45a4c8ddc60c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"af7c00331599"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"db3267ed53c9">
<td data-local-id=3D"4ea6fef06d42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"16208ab22cf9">
<li local-id=3D"25be20f44501">
<p local-id=3D"359ba00e8059"><strong>Cancel Order</strong></p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8d5accb2cbc3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6a2d5bc771f4">The number of orders created during the select=
ed date range that were <strong>cancelled</strong>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"1d0114fb9663"><strong>Calculation Rule</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3c57b695-9b60-4eea-968c-605186886e45">
